+# BLUE CURRENT V46.50.0 — FIRST AUTHORITATIVE MODULE RETIREMENT
+
+## Release scope
+
+V46.46–V46.50 performs Blue Current's first deliberate authoritative code retirement.
+
+Retired surface:
+
+`enterpriseValuePlanCenter`
+
+This is the candidate that previously passed:
+- operator evidence review
+- reversible hide preview
+- retirement certification
+- repository-impact analysis
+- disposable-copy retirement rehearsal
+- rollback/change-set generation
+- final retirement authorization-gate validation
+
+## V46.46 — Exact Runtime Retirement
+
+The authoritative V46.50 repository state removes:
+- `client/js/modules/enterpriseValuePlanCenter.js`
+- `client/js/modules/enterpriseValuePlanEngine.js`
+
+It also removes the retired surface from:
+- `client/index.html`
+- `client/js/app-v15.1.3.js`
